1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,872
Part one.

2
00:00:00,872 --> 00:00:03,424
The tourist praises everything.

3
00:00:03,424 --> 00:00:09,309
The view from the plane: neat fields, coloured houses, an age old peace.

4
00:00:09,309 --> 00:00:18,033
The East, he says, has only ever given to the West, religion, art, civilisation, without any idea of ownership.

5
00:00:18,033 --> 00:00:26,406
He knows the history from books: the valley as a lake, Manjushri's sword, the monks' pure samyak gaze.

